    "head_branch": "claude/optimistic-pasteur-prvvqh",
    "head_commit_message": "chore(ci): github-sync makes step issues and runs on spec changes (spec 40 step 1)\n\nPer spec: a parent issue `Spec NN: <title>` in its milestone and a sub-issue per\ndistinct `### Step <id>` heading, labelled `step:NN-<id>`, created closed when a PR\nwith that label has merged. Bodies link the spec and carry a marker; a marked step\nwhose heading is gone is closed as not planned with one comment. A PR changing a\nspec gets its milestone, and so does each open issue it closes, unless set. The\nworkflow runs on pushes to main and PRs that touch specs/, never two at once, and\nthe `handoff` label joins the fixed set.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Gy9GgRxzkk6fQAZDYUwF18",
